# old-system Readonly Rules

`old-system/` is read-only reference material.

Allowed: read files, search files, extract business rules, produce analysis in `docs/old-system-analysis/`.

Forbidden: edit, format, delete, install dependencies, run write scripts, or copy code into frontend/backend.
